PROGRESS (v1.4.10 -> v1.4.18) — USING ASDF: DEFSYSTEM now FULLY works; OPERATE
reached the plan/perform machinery.  Driven with a trivial 2-file system
(pkg.lisp + main.lisp :depends-on pkg) under
